Lets a custom geometry source fail a tile, as a custom vector source can, and
keeps a failed tile of either kind registered, so invalidating it fetches it
again. Cancelling a custom geometry tile also forgets it, as the custom vector
loader already does, so the tile fetches again when it is next required
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/778).
Upstream: not proposed

